🎓 Program 15 — File-Based Student Record Manager

📌 Description

This program demonstrates a file-based student record management system using text files.

It provides operations for adding, displaying, searching, and updating student records. The program combines file streams, string parsing, temporary-file replacement, and menu-driven programming.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- ➕ Add student records
- 📋 Display records
- 🔍 Search records
- ✏️ Update records
- 💾 Persistent text-file storage
- 🧩 Record parsing
- 🔄 Temporary-file update technique
- 🖥️ Menu-driven application

📁 Main File

"student_records.txt"

🧠 Main Concept

CRUD-style student record management using file handling
